I would not drop Q2. A line chart that connects Q1 to Q3 with no Q2 point, or a Q2 point hidden from the reader, would show revenue moving smoothly when it actually fell and recovered. Readers would reasonably take it as the full picture. Q2 has a clear, non-alarming cause, so I'd keep it in and explain it, which also helps the story.

